{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows挂载隐藏或WebDAV远程共享。对应需求：横向移动。官方：Mounting Hidden or WebDav Remote Shares。","from":"now-9m","index":["endgame-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-m365_defender.event-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*","logs-system.security*","logs-windows.forwarded*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","winlogbeat-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows挂载隐藏或WebDAV远程共享","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows挂载隐藏或WebDAV远程共享\n\n### 为何重要\n向其他主机扩散\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","risk_score":47,"rule_id":"c4210e1c-64f2-4f48-b67e-b5a8ffe3aa14","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 横向移动","来源: 默认","对应需求: 横向移动"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"start\" and\n ((process.name : \"net.exe\" or ?process.pe.original_file_name == \"net.exe\") or ((process.name : \"net1.exe\" or ?process.pe.original_file_name == \"net1.exe\") and\n not process.parent.name : \"net.exe\")) and\n process.args : \"use\" and\n /* including hidden and webdav based online shares such as onedrive  */\n process.args : (\"\\\\\\\\*\\\\*$*\", \"\\\\\\\\*@SSL\\\\*\", \"http*\") and\n /* excluding shares deletion operation */\n not process.args : \"/d*\"\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1021","name":"Remote Services","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1021/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1021.002","name":"SMB/Windows Admin Shares","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1021/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0008","name":"Lateral Movement","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0008/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1078","name":"Valid Accounts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1078.003","name":"Local Accounts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/003/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0001","name":"Initial Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0001/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1087","name":"Account Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1087/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1087.001","name":"Local Account","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1087/001/"},{"id":"T1087.002","name":"Domain Account","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1087/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0007","name":"Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0007/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"system","version":"*"},{"package":"m365_defender","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":318,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now","references":[]}
